<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia to issue bonds worth 15 billion tugriks.</title>
<headline>Mongolia to issue bonds worth 15 billion tugriks.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia will issue government bonds worth 15 billion tugriks ($27.3 million) this year, its first such issue, officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Senior government officials said the bonds would be issued later this year and detailed regulations were being drafted following a decision by parliament on Sept 3.</p>
<p>Officials declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
